<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
<title>文章不存在 · Knowledge Publisher</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Space+Grotesk:wght@500;600;700&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/static/tokens.css">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/static/kp.css">
<style>
  .nf {
    max-width: 40rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: var(--space-3xl) var(--space-xl) var(--space-3xl);
    min-width: 0;
  }
  .nf__code {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    color: var(--color-neutral);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
  }
  .nf__title {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 4vw + 0.5rem, 2.5rem);
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    line-height: 1.2;
    color: var(--color-ink);
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }
  .nf__lede {
    margin-top: var(--space-sm);
    max-width: 36ch;
    font-size: var(--text-md);
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--color-ink-2);
  }
  .nf__actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: var(--space-sm);
    margin-top: var(--space-lg);
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header class="topbar">
  <a class="brand" href="/" aria-label="返回文章列表">
    <span class="brand__mark" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    <span class="brand__name">Knowledge&nbsp;Publisher</span>
  </a>
  <h1 class="topbar__title">文章不存在</h1>
</header>

<main class="nf">
  <p class="nf__code">404 · {{ name }}</p>
  <h1 class="nf__title">这篇文章不存在或已被删除</h1>
  <p class="nf__lede">它可能已经被删除，或者地址有误。回到文章列表继续管理你的内容。</p>
  <div class="nf__actions">
    <a class="btn btn--primary" href="/">返回文章列表</a>
    <a class="btn" href="/guide">使用指南</a>
  </div>
</main>

<footer class="foot">
  <span class="foot__brand">Knowledge Publisher</span>
  <span class="foot__tag">一次创作，多平台输出</span>
</footer>
</body>
</html>
